      "webb",
      "tesla-deliveries"
    ]
  },
  "reflection": {
    "what_people_were_focused_on": "The new coronavirus was an international emergency. Boeing faced grounded planes, Disney celebrated a film, and Britain prepared to leave the EU.",
    "what_actually_mattered": "Single-company risks mattered. A basket spread money among many businesses, while a single share tied the result to one company’s fortunes.",
    "what_faded_away": "A box-office record or a profitable quarter did not protect a company from later shocks. Starting news described only part of the risk.",
    "what_nobody_knew": "People did not yet know how far the outbreak would spread or how economies would respond. The exact winners and losses were also unknown.",
